  "alt": {
    "en": "Three time steps reuse the same parameters. Red enters state [1,0], key halves it to [0.5,0], and is halves it to [0.25,0]. Each new state becomes the next old state.",
    "zh-hans": "三个时间步复用同一套参数。red 产生状态 [1,0]，key 使它减半为 [0.5,0]，is 再使它减半为 [0.25,0]。每步的新状态成为下一步的旧状态。"
  },
  "caption": {
    "en": "Figure 11.1 — Three uses of one recurrent update; the numerical state crosses time.",
    "zh-hans": "图 11.1 — 同一个递归更新用三次，数值状态沿时间传递。"
  },
